# Contributing to {{ project_name }}

## Setup

```bash
uv sync --extra dev
```

## Checks (all must pass before a PR)

```bash
just check    # the commit stage, on the engine — what the commit hook runs
just gate     # the push stage, on the engine — what the push hook runs
just types
just test
```

The door runs the same two stages on every pull; nothing lints locally. Keep changes scoped; adjacent
cleanup is a separate commit.

Pull template updates with `copier update` (3-way merged against local edits).
